sequenceDiagram
  accTitle: Image Analysis and Human Verification Sequence
  accDescr: Ordered calls and returns for upload, real inference, storage, database persistence and human feedback. Notes distinguish API revision from the current UI.
  participant B as Browser / React
  participant N as Next.js API
  participant A as FastAPI
  participant Y as YOLO module
  participant S as Image storage
  participant D as PostgreSQL
  Note over B,N: User selects image and Analyze image
  B->>N: POST /api/detectra/analyze<br/>multipart image
  N->>A: POST /analyze
  Note over A,Y: Validate MIME, 10 MiB limit,<br/>and decodable image
  A->>Y: detector.detect(data, model)
  Y-->>A: Labels, confidence, boxes
  A->>S: record(): storage.save(bytes)
  S-->>A: Storage key and image URL
  A->>D: model_id(), INSERT image / detections<br/>conn.commit()
  D-->>A: Persisted records
  A-->>N: 201 AnalysisResult
  N-->>B: Validate / map to DetectionResult
  Note over B,N: Show results, proxy image bytes<br/>through /api/detectra/images/*
  Note over B,N: Select reviewer, reveal box,<br/>choose Correct or Incorrect
  B->>N: POST /api/detectra/verify<br/>result, detection, reviewer, verdict
  N->>A: POST /detections/{id}/verify
  A->>D: Check parent, lock image and detection<br/>INSERT human_verifications<br/>Relink detection, update image totals
  D-->>A: Review record, transaction commits<br/>on successful request
  A-->>N: 201 HumanVerificationRead
  N-->>B: Validated review ID, show saved verdict
  Note over B,D: Reload reconstructs persisted feedback from records.
  Note over B,D: Repeat verification API calls create a new review and replace its link.<br/>The current results UI has no revision button.
  Note over A,D: No detections: POST /images/{image_id}/verify records an image-level verdict.<br/>Incorrect means a missed target, no detection row is invented.
  Note over A,D: Invalid input is rejected. Known failed writes roll back and compensate stored files.<br/>An uncertain commit retains the file, unconfirmed feedback is not shown as saved.
